  "status": "ready",
  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……ああ、そういえば。\nこの間、両親に宛てた手紙の話をしましたよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "少し驚きましたよ。\nまさか全員書いたことがあるとは。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "東雲が書いた手紙、大体の予想がつくよ。\n付き合いも長いしな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "その言葉、そっくりお返しします。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ははは。あの時まで手紙の存在を忘れてたのに、\n内容は結構覚えてるんだ。不思議だよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……俺の両親は、教育熱心で厳しい人達だったろ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "自由な生き方に憧れる自分とは合わないって、\nお前にも昔、散々愚痴をこぼしたと思うが……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "手紙にも、そう書いたんだ。\n「俺はもっと自由に生きたい！」って。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だが、結局渡さずじまいだった。\n高校を出てすぐ家を飛び出したからね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「もっと自由に生きたい」「もっと俺を理解して\nほしい」……確か、そんな事ばかり書いていたよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "当時の俺は、本当に自分勝手で子供っぽかったな。\n……いや、今もそう変わらないか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "家を飛び出したきり、一度も帰らず……。\nカフェを始めたり、アイドルを始めたり。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "勝手なことばかりしてるんだからな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……私だって、同じようなものです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_d:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "家業の和菓子屋から逃げ出して、\nここで、洋菓子の研究ばかりしているんですから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
